{"generated": "2026-10-18 19:46", "brief": "<b>1. SK하이닉스 자회사 솔리다임의 미국 상장 및 중복상장 논란</b>\nSK하이닉스의 자회사 솔리다임이 미국 증시 상장을 추진하면서 중복상장에 따른 주주가치 훼손 우려와 투자 자금 확보라는 실익을 둘러싼 논란이 확산하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTFBrOEh6OWwxU3BRTVZ4SmlGay1qY0gxQmFlZG9aaWdiZE9uYmJSVjhUU0dESTFMNThzUWI2d0FkM0xCT05oamYwZG5vSWVYbDNFYUltM25TQVlOY2UwYlVvQktlR0JXc01hOGc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#13</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE02Vi1ZVkpuMXNFNm1ld2ZOUTVLbjBvTVdKMkJsbzkydUtSUy14S3p0cG9aN0VRemdTR05nVFMtVzZwNTBiWUNUWGtBT3lKRHZjMTFtcVFjNzV1aExiNXc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOTUF2aVI0M3BkQnBHcHdKX041aEphQzZjRzBabTM5elE0YkhENkN2VjdQVnJGTFVWeWZKUkpfWXlLZjlid0pYQy1qN0ZvQW1CX2xySHhiUUl3VXZxSFE0SzhKNkhoUDdUcXFoVDZnNGhoN2ZPc3pJTHJZcEhHSzh0Ug?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a>]. 미·중 갈등 여파와 정치권의 시선까지 더해져 SK그룹의 자본시장 셈법과 주가 향방이 시험대에 올랐습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTFBrOEh6OWwxU3BRTVZ4SmlGay1qY0gxQmFlZG9aaWdiZE9uYmJSVjhUU0dESTFMNThzUWI2d0FkM0xCT05oamYwZG5vSWVYbDNFYUltM25TQVlOY2UwYlVvQktlR0JXc01hOGc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#13</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE91QnlNMDRBa2hhQUE5VG9HLWt0ZzBWb3c0VWFtN051cjQ1VkFWUm1pY3pZQ1RCd0ZMajByZThGVll2U2Q2bkhyZEl1QzNTaGdTaUNsYmQwdHhOZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a>].\n\n<b>2. 홈플러스 매각 난항 및 실적 부진 장기화</b>\n홈플러스가 매출 부진과 연휴 실적 반등 실패로 매각 돌파구를 찾지 못하며 M&amp;A가 난항을 겪고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE5jTW1BYVlVRm9WYTVBamUxZ24xWFhpNjJNWVNjNmZFZVVEcGVua2phMkhSNG42LVJQS2syYWJoUUZqQ2dQS2ZGSzExTTZyWkk?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#8</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE40b1dYSV9HODFMZUc0YUhJYWhsWWtHSmdUV0E4dXBXdTJWby1xRUpobzBEYnNITnd5b1hKUjJlUU1CQXMzSURZLXhOY0Q0eGNaU25vYnhNTHB0dw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a>]. 위로금조차 없